                <pb facs="0216" n="132" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg132"/>

                <head>MESSAGE FROM THE PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES, TRANSMITTING A REPORT FROM
                    THE SECRETARY OF STATE, WITH ACCOMPANYING PAPERS, CONCERNING THE CONVENTION
                    BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND COLOMBIA FOR THE CONSTRUCTION OF AN INTEROCEANIC
                    CANAL ACROSS THE ISTHMUS OF PANAMA.</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To the Senate and House of
                        Representatives:</hi></p>
                <p>I transmit, for the information of the Congress, in connection with the
                    correspondence already transmitted relating to the recent revolution on the
                    Isthmus of Panama, and contained in House Document No. 8, Fifty-eighth Congress,
                    first session, parts 1 and 2,<anchor n="a" xml:id="d105-f1"/> a report from the
                    Secretary of State, with accompanying papers concerning the convention between
                    the United States and Colombia for the construction of an interoceanic canal
                    across the Isthmus of Panama.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore Roosevelt.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">White
                                House</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d105-a1.xml" xpointer="d105-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
